{name,id} pairs, output names, sha256) and finish. Record any discrepancy as a \"DISCREPANCY:\" line (where, expected, found, date) rather than repairing it. If any step is impossible or malformed, stop and report truthfully; do not expand scope."},"permitted":true}}}
