 output names, sha256) and finish. Record any discrepancy as a \"DISCREPANCY:\" line (where, expected, found, date) rather than repairing it. If any step is impossible or malformed, stop and report truthfully; do not expand scope."},"output":{"ledger":"hybrid-20260928t184543z-230a8f03","id":"20260928T184543Z:80","name":"agent/governor/brief-task6-owner","author":"hybrid-20260928t184543z-230a8f03/governor","tags":["agent","agent-brief"]},"success":true}}}
